* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
* SKY130 circuits. Geometry is in microns, as required by the PDK subcircuits.
* IREF is an external 35 uA current SINK, VREF an external buffered 1.2 V reference.
* No ideal active components are used in the implementation subcircuits.

.subckt lvds_inv18 A Y VDD VSS
XP Y A VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.15
XN Y A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.15
.ends lvds_inv18

.subckt lvds_inv18_drive A Y VDD VSS
XP Y A VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=16 l=0.15
XN Y A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.15
.ends lvds_inv18_drive

.subckt lvds_inv18_boost A Y VDD VSS
XP Y A VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=64 l=0.15
XN Y A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=32 l=0.15
.ends lvds_inv18_boost

.subckt lvds_inv33 A Y VDD VSS
* Threshold balances the CML drain swing, preserving complementary duty.
* Sized to drive the four switch-gate drivers and their extracted wiring.
XP Y A VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=72 l=0.5
XN Y A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
.ends lvds_inv33

.subckt lvds_inv33_small A Y VDD VSS
XP Y A VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=64 l=0.5
XN Y A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=16 l=0.5
.ends lvds_inv33_small

* Second-stage switch-gate drivers. The output PMOS and NMOS switch pairs need
* different gate crossing levels to stay make-before-break: PMOS gates fall
* fast and rise slowly (cross low); NMOS gates rise fast and fall slowly
* (cross high). A single shared gate signal starves one tail source on every
* edge, which accumulates as pattern-dependent common-mode wander. The slow
* sides are sized for the extracted gate-net wiring load, which is larger
* than the switch gates themselves.
.subckt lvds_inv33_plow A Y VDD VSS
XP Y A VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=8 l=0.5
XN Y A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=64 l=0.5
.ends lvds_inv33_plow

.subckt lvds_inv33_nhigh A Y VDD VSS
XP Y A VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=48 l=0.5
XN Y A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=8 l=0.5
.ends lvds_inv33_nhigh

.subckt lvds_shift18_33 A Q QB NB VDDIO VDDD VSS
* Differential current-mode level conversion avoids a regenerative latch's
* unequal recovery times at 800 Mb/s. Every 3.3 V node uses thick-oxide FETs.
XIN0 A INB VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
XIN1 INB AD VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_boost
XI AD AB VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_boost
* Devices are listed in placement order: the generated layout places them
* in this order, so each drain net (L, R) stays local.
XNA0 L AD T VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=80 l=0.5
XNA1 L AD T VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=80 l=0.5
* Two approximately 2 kohm resistors in parallel on each drain.
XRL0 VDDIO L VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRL1 VDDIO L VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XB0 L Q VDDIO VSS lvds_inv33
XNB0 R AB T VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=80 l=0.5
XNB1 R AB T VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=80 l=0.5
XRR0 VDDIO R VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRR1 VDDIO R VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XB1 R QB VDDIO VSS lvds_inv33
XTAIL0 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL1 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL2 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL3 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL4 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL5 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL6 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL7 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL8 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL9 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL10 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XTAIL11 T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
* AB lacks the inverter gate load that AD has. Matching it bounds the
* feedthrough overshoot on this 1.8 V node to the thin-oxide terminal limit.
XCAB AB VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=10 l=10
.ends lvds_shift18_33

.subckt lvds_bias IREF NB VDDIO VSS
XPREF IREF IREF VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=2 l=1
XPM NB IREF VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=2 l=1
XNREF NB NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=2 l=1
* Local reference storage reduces switching feedthrough into the shared bias.
XCBP IREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=10 l=10
XCBN NB VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=10 l=10
.ends lvds_bias

.subckt lvds_cmfb PLUS MINUS OUT NB VDDIO VSS
XNP L PLUS T VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=8 l=1
XNM OUT MINUS T VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=8 l=1
XNT T NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=2 l=1
XPL L L VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=4 l=1
XPR OUT L VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=4 l=1
XCCOMP0 OUT VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=29 l=29
XCCOMP1 OUT VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=29 l=29
XCCOMP2 OUT VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=29 l=29
XCCOMP3 OUT VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=29 l=29
XCCOMP4 OUT VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=29 l=29
XCCOMP5 OUT VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=29 l=29
.ends lvds_cmfb

.subckt openlvds_driver_core D OUTP OUTN VREF PB NB VDDIO VDDD VSS
XLS D DP DN NB VDDIO VDDD VSS lvds_shift18_33
* Each switch group sits next to its own gate drivers (placement follows
* this order), which keeps the gate nets short. Two PMOS switches per side
* keep the PMOS mirror out of triode.
XGPL DP GPL VDDIO VSS lvds_inv33_plow
XPL OUTP GPL TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XPL1 OUTP GPL TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XGNL DP GNL VDDIO VSS lvds_inv33_nhigh
XNL OUTP GNL BOT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=40 l=0.5
XGPR DN GPR VDDIO VSS lvds_inv33_plow
XPR OUTN GPR TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XPR1 OUTN GPR TOP VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=60 l=0.5
XGNR DN GNR VDDIO VSS lvds_inv33_nhigh
XNR OUTN GNR BOT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=40 l=0.5
* 100:1 PMOS mirror establishes approximately 3.5 mA steering current.
XIT0 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT1 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT2 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT3 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT4 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT5 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT6 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT7 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT8 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIT9 TOP PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB0 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB1 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB2 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB3 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB4 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB5 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB6 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB7 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB8 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
XIB9 BOT SINK VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=1
* A 0.96 feedback divider centers the output near 1.25 V using VREF=1.2 V.
XRCP OUTP CM VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=10.25
XRCN OUTN CM VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=10.25
XRCM0 CM CMS VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=60
XRCM1 CMS VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=60
* Local symmetric MIM loads bound switch-feedthrough common-mode ripple and,
* with the 100 ohm termination, the 2 pF pin load and about 0.85 pF of
* extracted output wiring, set the 20-80% edges inside the TIA/EIA-644-A
* window of 260 ps to 0.3 tui at 580-620 Mb/s.
XCOUTP OUTP VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=24 l=24
XCOUTP1 OUTP VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=24 l=24
XCOUTN OUTN VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=24 l=24
XCOUTN1 OUTN VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=24 l=24
XCM CM VREF SINK NB VDDIO VSS lvds_cmfb
.ends openlvds_driver_core

.subckt openlvds_driver D OUTP OUTN VREF IREF VDDIO VDDD VSS
XB IREF NB VDDIO VSS lvds_bias
XCORE D OUTP OUTN VREF IREF NB VDDIO VDDD VSS openlvds_driver_core
.ends openlvds_driver

.subckt openlvds_receiver_core INP INN Q VREF PB NB VDDIO VDDD VSS
* Complementary input pairs with mirrored differential current summation.
* Input-pair drains remain inside the thick-oxide device domain.
XNT NT NB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=12 l=1
XNP NL INP NT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=0.5
XNN NR INN NT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=20 l=0.5
XNDL NL NL VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
XNDR NR NR VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
XNML PP NL VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
XNMR PN NR VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
XPT PT PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=12 l=1
* Below about 0.8 V common mode only this PMOS pair is active. Its
* transconductance sets how later-stage mismatch refers to the input: 80 um
* holds the 3-sigma input offset near 60 mV, inside the 100 mV threshold.
XPP PL INP PT VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=80 l=0.5
XPN PR INN PT VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=80 l=0.5
XPDL PL PL VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
XPDR PR PR VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
XPML PP PL VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
XPMR PN PR VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 w=10 l=0.5
* Each input load is 2k || 4k to VREF and 4k to ground.
* Its Thevenin equivalent is 1k at 0.9 V for a 1.2 V external reference.
* This preserves differential gain while retaining decision-stage headroom.
XPCB NBC PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=2 l=1
XNCB NBC NBC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XCT CT NBC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=64 l=0.5
XC0 CL PN CT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.15
XC1 CO PP CT VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.15
XCD CL CL VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.15
XCM CO CL VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.15
* Restore at the actual capture-clock load, not just an unloaded pad probe.
XI CO Q VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
XRLPPA PP VREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPPB PP PPRT VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPPC PPRT VREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPPD PP PPRB VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPPE PPRB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPNA PN VREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPNB PN PNRT VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPNC PNRT VREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPND PN PNRB VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XRLPNE PNRB VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
.ends openlvds_receiver_core

.subckt openlvds_receiver INP INN Q VREF IREF VDDIO VDDD VSS
XB IREF NB VDDIO VSS lvds_bias
XCORE INP INN Q VREF IREF NB VDDIO VDDD VSS openlvds_receiver_core
.ends openlvds_receiver

.subckt lvds_delay_inv A Y CTRL PCTRL VDDD VSS
* Symmetric current starvation preserves the clock duty cycle.
XH T PCTRL VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=32 l=0.5
XP Y A T VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=8 l=0.15
XN Y A F VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.15
XC F CTRL VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=16 l=0.5
XCL Y VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=2 l=2
.ends lvds_delay_inv

.subckt lvds_delay_section A Y CTRL VDDD VSS
* Local matched current mirror supplies the complementary header bias.
XBP PCTRL PCTRL VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=32 l=0.5
XBN PCTRL CTRL VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=16 l=0.5
X0 A N CTRL PCTRL VDDD VSS lvds_delay_inv
X1 N S CTRL PCTRL VDDD VSS lvds_delay_inv
XB0 S B VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
XB1 B Y VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
.ends lvds_delay_section

.subckt openlvds_delay_line A P90 P180 P270 P360 CTRL VDDD VSS
X0 A P90 CTRL VDDD VSS lvds_delay_section
X1 P90 P180 CTRL VDDD VSS lvds_delay_section
X2 P180 P270 CTRL VDDD VSS lvds_delay_section
X3 P270 P360 CTRL VDDD VSS lvds_delay_section
.ends openlvds_delay_line

* Rising-edge phase qualification. The digital detector restores QREF/QFB/QWIN
* and returns a rising-window-masked raw-clock XOR on ERR. PC is the DLL
* seven-microamp PMOS mirror bias. This block does not use UP/DN pulse widths.
.subckt lvds_phase_qualifier REF FB WINDOW ERR BAD QREF QFB QWIN PC VDDD VSS
XQRR REF QREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XQRC QREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=5 l=12
XQFR FB QFB VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XQFC QFB VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=5 l=12
XQWR WINDOW QWIN VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XQWC QWIN VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=5 l=12
* Average the error pulses before comparison; do not require a short pulse
* to propagate through a digital latch at the slow process corner.
XRF ERR FILTER VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=8.5
XCF FILTER VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=20 l=25
* Seventeen upper units and one lower unit give VDDD/18 = 100 mV.
* Identical resistor units retain the ratio including PDK end resistance.
XFR0 VDDD FR0 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR1 FR0 FR1 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR2 FR1 FR2 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR3 FR2 FR3 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR4 FR3 FR4 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR5 FR4 FR5 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR6 FR5 FR6 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR7 FR6 FR7 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR8 FR7 FR8 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR9 FR8 FR9 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR10 FR9 FR10 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR11 FR10 FR11 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR12 FR11 FR12 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR13 FR12 FR13 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR14 FR13 FR14 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR15 FR14 FR15 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFR16 FR15 FREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFRB FREF VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XFRC FREF VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=10 l=10
XAT FTAIL PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XAP FLOAD FILTER FTAIL VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=8 l=1
XAM PCO FREF FTAIL VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=8 l=1
XANL FLOAD FLOAD VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=1
XANR PCO FLOAD VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=1
XF0 PCO FBAD_B VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
XF1 FBAD_B BAD VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
.ends lvds_phase_qualifier

.subckt lvds_ctrl_buffer IN OUT PB VDDIO VSS
* PMOS inputs on 3.3 V retain headroom at the fast-corner control voltage.
* Long-channel mirror loads reduce systematic follower offset.
XPP L IN T VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=64.0 l=1
XPM OUT OUT T VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=64.0 l=1
XPT T PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=32.0 l=2.5
XNL L L VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=32.0 l=1
XNR OUT L VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=32.0 l=1
XCC OUT VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=25 l=40
.ends lvds_ctrl_buffer

.subckt openlvds_dll_analog CLK PD_ENABLE PH0 PH90 PH180 PH270 FB PD_REF PHASE_BAD UP DN ERR PB VDDIO VDDD VSS QREF QFB QWIN SENSE_REF SENSE_FB SENSE_WINDOW
* Reference and delay-line outputs have restored, matched edge slew.
XR0 CLK R0 VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
XR1 R0 PH0 VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
XL PH0 PH90 PH180 PH270 FB CTRL VDDD VSS openlvds_delay_line
* Match the last tap's input loading to the other three sections.
XREPL FB DUMMY CTRL VDDD VSS lvds_delay_section
* Invert the reference and compare it to the half-period tap. This excludes
* zero-delay acquisition and keeps feedback outside the reset blind interval.
XPDINV PH0 PD_REF VDDD VSS lvds_inv18_drive
* Sense terminals are tied to PD_REF/PH180/PH90 in the assembled core.
* Standalone fault tests may drive them independently of the DLL loop.
XQUAL SENSE_REF SENSE_FB SENSE_WINDOW ERR PHASE_BAD QREF QFB QWIN PC VDDD VSS lvds_phase_qualifier
* Match the passive sensing load on the remaining delay-line taps.
XQ270R PH270 Q270 VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XQ270C Q270 VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=5 l=12
XQFBR FB QLAST VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XQFBC QLAST VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=5 l=12
* Bias conversion from the externally supplied IREF sink to 1.8 V mirrors.
XBR NC PB VDDIO VDDIO sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 w=2 l=1
* Five identical reference units and one output unit on each side avoid
* narrow-width model differences between fractional-width current mirrors.
XBN0 NC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBN1 NC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBN2 NC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBN3 NC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBN4 NC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBP0 PC PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XBP1 PC PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XBP2 PC PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XBP3 PC PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XBP4 PC PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XBPN0 PC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBPN1 PC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBPN2 PC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBPN3 PC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XBPN4 PC NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
* Thirty-two matched units per branch provide approximately 224 uA.
* The 2 pF storage capacitor retains switching-feedthrough suppression.
XCPU U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XCPU1 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XCU CTRL UPB U VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.15
XADDUN CTRL UP U VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.15
XUPINV UP UPB VDDD VSS lvds_inv18
XCD CTRL DN D VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.15
XADDDP CTRL DNB D VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.15
XCPD D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XCPD1 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
* Keep both current-source drains near VCTRL while their main switches are
* off. This suppresses charge sharing from floating U/D nodes every cycle.
XCUDUMP VCOPY UP U VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.15
XADDUDN VCOPY UPB U VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.15
XDNB DN DNB VDDD VSS lvds_inv18
XCDDUMP VCOPY DNB D VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.15
XADDDDP VCOPY DN D VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.15
XCC0 CTRL VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=30 l=30
XCC1 CTRL VSS sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=10 l=10
* Start at minimum delay to exclude multiple-period acquisition.
* A resistor and transmission gate precharge the real loop capacitor.
XRP0 VDDD PRE VSS sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 w=0.35 l=1.25
XEN PD_ENABLE ENB VDDD VSS lvds_inv18
XPREN CTRL ENB PRE VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.15
XPREP CTRL PD_ENABLE PRE VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.15
XVCOPY CTRL VCOPY PB VDDIO VSS lvds_ctrl_buffer
XADDCP0 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN0 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP1 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN1 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP2 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN2 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP3 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN3 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP4 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN4 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP5 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN5 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP6 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN6 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP7 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN7 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP8 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN8 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP9 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN9 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP10 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN10 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP11 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN11 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
XADDCP12 U PC VDDD VDDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=4 l=0.5
XADDCN12 D NC VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=0.5
